# Model weights are never committed (AGENTS.md hard rule 10).
# The sentence-transformers model cache is downloaded on first run by
# scripts/fetch_uniclass.py / src/embedder.py and cached here so the pipeline
# runs offline afterwards.
models--sentence-transformers--*
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.bin
# Derived title vectors: rebuilt on demand by src/embedder.py
uniclass_embeddings_*.npy